bluejetty:00028239:android.description:
Protect Sheep is a puzzle game. You need to play as a shepherd to save your flock from the many wolves and protect the little lambs. Click the screen to preset wooden stakes on the grass, and separate the sheep and wolves with wooden stakes. Each level has a certain number of stakes. After the preset is completed, click the build button, and the stakes will rise from the ground. Protect the flock, if the wolf does not eat the sheep it will win the game.
How to play:
1. Click on the screen to place the stake;
2. Pay attention to the maximum number of stakes in each level;
3. Encircle the sheep or wolves with stakes;
4. To separate the sheep from the wolf;
5. Confirm that it is correct, click the build button, and the stake will appear;
6. If no sheep are eaten by wolves, the game is won.
Game Features:
1. Rich and interesting levels;
2. The background story of wolf eating sheep;
3. Experience the life of a farmer;
4. Interesting construction experience.
Welcome to try our game, if you have any comments on the game, you can give feedback in the game, thank you for your participation.

